    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d6fa8444ffaf158d1e5bc369950eab5b.poster.avif?t=1680171577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d6fa8444ffaf158d1e5bc369950eab5b.webm?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d6fa8444ffaf158d1e5bc369950eab5b.mp4?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Shockwave is a first-person immersive bomb disposal sim with stealth mechanics that lets you taste an anxious life of a sapper. Work with specialistic equipment to disarm a wide range of explosives. Gather intel to choose the right path in the multi-layered levels and stay out of sight from armed militants.<br><br>In Shockwave, you will experience immersive, authentic bomb disposal \u2014 verified by world-leading IED experts. Starting from simple improvised charges, through complex, procedurally generated IEDs to immense hand-crafted puzzles with a racing countdown. So hurry up, but be careful\u2026 or else\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/60a9898cba71ba4a1baa511163973dc9.poster.avif?t=1680171577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/60a9898cba71ba4a1baa511163973dc9.webm?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/60a9898cba71ba4a1baa511163973dc9.mp4?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Bombs don't just &quot;deal damage in a radius&quot; \u2014 they generate a shockwave with thermal, chemical and EMP components, which interact with items and architecture.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/c28ba7303db65aa7ba85b44d47015de1.poster.avif?t=1680171577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/c28ba7303db65aa7ba85b44d47015de1.webm?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/c28ba7303db65aa7ba85b44d47015de1.mp4?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Work with an authentic EOD robot, the trademark hook-and-line, set water charges, and scan the environment with radars and IR cameras. Wear EOD armor to survive mistakes or leave it behind to stay agile.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d50b591ecdd1286b729e7e3f8911d8eb.poster.avif?t=1680171577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d50b591ecdd1286b729e7e3f8911d8eb.webm?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d50b591ecdd1286b729e7e3f8911d8eb.mp4?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Keep a low profile and never antagonize the locals; stay out of sight of armed militants, or they will hunt you down. As a bomb disposal expert, you are a priority target in the area. The enemy will do everything to neutralize you.<br><br>Gather precious intel and put together information to make the right preparations and find your way through multi-layered levels in the vein of games such as Deus Ex and Thief.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d6fa8444ffaf158d1e5bc369950eab5b.poster.avif?t=1680171577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d6fa8444ffaf158d1e5bc369950eab5b.webm?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/d6fa8444ffaf158d1e5bc369950eab5b.mp4?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Shockwave is a first-person immersive bomb disposal sim with stealth mechanics that lets you taste an anxious life of a sapper. Work with specialistic equipment to disarm a wide range of explosives. Gather intel to choose the right path in the multi-layered levels and stay out of sight from armed militants.<br><br>In Shockwave, you will experience immersive, authentic bomb disposal \u2014 verified by world-leading IED experts. Starting from simple improvised charges, through complex, procedurally generated IEDs to immense hand-crafted puzzles with a racing countdown. So hurry up, but be careful\u2026 or else\u2026<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/60a9898cba71ba4a1baa511163973dc9.poster.avif?t=1680171577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/60a9898cba71ba4a1baa511163973dc9.webm?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2056750/extras/60a9898cba71ba4a1baa511163973dc9.mp4?t=1680171577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Bombs don't just &quot;deal damage in a radius&quot; \u2014 they generate a shockwave with thermal, chemical and EMP components, which interact 